# PROJECT: PREMIUM SOFTWARE DEVELOPER PORTFOLIO WEBSITE

## ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, frontend developer, backend developer, and portfolio branding expert.

Create a complete, modern, responsive, professional developer portfolio website using Google AI Studio with Gemini-powered Vibe Coding.

The website must be inspired by the reference image provided by the user.

The reference design features:
- A clean white background.
- Oversized light-gray typography in the background.
- A large professional portrait on the right.
- A bold introduction on the left.
- A minimalist vertical navigation menu.
- Floating social media icons on the right.
- Black buttons and subtle yellow accents.
- A clean, premium, minimalist appearance.

Reinterpret these design elements for a fresher pursuing Java Developer, Backend Developer, and Full Stack Developer opportunities.

Do not create a generic portfolio template. Make the website visually distinctive, technically professional, easy to navigate, and suitable for recruiters.

The final website must contain real navigation, functional links, responsive layouts, interactive components, and complete portfolio sections.

