# 1. OVERALL THEME

Theme name: Minimalist Developer Identity.

Create a premium, monochrome portfolio with a modern editorial design.

The website should communicate:
- Technical competence.
- Professionalism.
- Creativity.
- Attention to detail.
- Problem-solving ability.
- Passion for software development.

The overall appearance should resemble a carefully designed personal website rather than a standard resume template.

Use generous whitespace, carefully aligned elements, oversized typography, thin borders, subtle shadows, and restrained animation.

Avoid:
- Excessive gradients.
- Too many bright colors.
- Unnecessary glassmorphism.
- Excessive rounded cards.
- Crowded layouts.
- Generic stock illustrations.
- Unnecessary animations.
- Large numbers of decorative elements.

Maintain visual consistency across every section.

The portfolio should look impressive on desktop while remaining fully usable on mobile devices.

